    "title": "New Castle man found guilty in Liberty Township beating - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tristan Hostetter, Multimedia Producer ,\n6 hours ago TRUMBULL COUNTY — A New Castle man was found guilty by a Trumbull County jury Tuesday after beating a woman in Liberty, resulting in the victim losing a tooth. 33-year-old Justin Fry-Starrett was found guilty of felonious assault, a second-degree felony, and domestic violence and failure to comply with the order or signal of a police officer, both third-degree felonies. Read full article\n2",
